     "id": "c001",
     "shot": "h_room",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The entire history of California is sitting in your room right now.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c002",
     "shot": "h_things",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The jeans you're wearing, the phone in your hand, the app you're watching this on,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:jeans",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:phone",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:app",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c003",
     "shot": "h_things",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the movies you grew up with, even the almonds in your kitchen.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tick",
       "w:movies",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "tick",
       "w:almonds",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c004",
     "shot": "h_globe",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "All of it came from one strip of coast, a coast named after an island that *never* existed.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c005",
     "shot": "h_novel",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "No really, the name comes from a Spanish adventure novel from 1510",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c006",
     "shot": "h_novel",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "about an island of warrior women where the only metal was gold.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:gold.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c007",
     "shot": "h_island",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And for more than 100 years, real map makers drew California as an island.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "scribble",
       10,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c008",
     "shot": "h_decree",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "A king of Spain finally had to announce it officially, California is *not* an island.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:not",
       0.7
      ],
      [
       "clang",
       "end",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c009",
     "shot": "h_econ",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Today, that not-island has one of the *five* biggest economies on Earth.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       6,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c010",
     "shot": "h_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the man who found California's gold died poor, so did the man who owned the land,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:poor,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c011",
     "shot": "h_board",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "so did the first millionaire the gold ever made.",
